This is a production-ready QA Automation architecture built with Playwright and TypeScript. It implements the Page Object Model (POM) design pattern, robust locator priority strategies, environment variable configuration, clean trace logging, and Enterprise-grade test structure.

---

### 📂 Folder Structure

```
automation-project/
├── .env
├── package.json
├── playwright.config.ts
├── pages/
│   ├── BasePage.ts
│   └── UserManagementPage.ts
├── tests/
│   └── user-management.spec.ts
└── utils/
    └── envUtils.ts
```

---

### --- Configuration & Dependencies

#### `.env`
```env
# Application Base URL
BASE_URL=https://app.example.com

# Sensitive Credentials (Placeholders)
TEST_EMAIL=user@example.com
TEST_PASSWORD=SecurePassword123!
```

#### `utils/envUtils.ts`
